  351 27D4 ~            ; one at bit 63. The remainder in qa, with its sixty-fifth bit, after the shift, in the carry. The
  352 27D4 ~            ; quotient's bits gather in C and go to qr a byte at a time, from the top: fifty-six of them, bits
  353 27D4 ~            ; 63 to 8, the fifty-three of the result and three below, and what remains then is the sticky bit,
