 1473 27D4 ~                ; smaller's in DEHL for the shift. Anything else goes the general way below, everything stored
 1474 27D4 ~                ; as __x80_fp_load2 would have. Some 750 T-states where that took 1290 (ivagor, zx-pk.ru).
 1475 27D4 ~                LD   (__x80_fpa),HL
