 2849 27D4 ~            ; e_sqrtf.c, so the same as (float)sqrt(x).
 2850 27D4 ~            ;
 2851 27D4 ~            ; ix, the remainder, in BCDE; t, twice the root so far with the bit being tried, in fpa, low byte
 2852 27D4 ~            ; first; that bit in fpb, within its byte of t; the result's exponent in fpb+1. The bytes of t
 2853 27D4 ~            ; below the bit's are zero: only those from the bit's up are compared and subtracted, a phase of
